<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="http-api">
  <title>Create and list users</title>
  <body>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='test {"testId":"http-api","detectSteps":false}'/>
    <p>Check that the API is up: send a <codeph>GET</codeph> request to <codeph>http://localhost:8092/api/health</codeph>.</p>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"httpRequest":"http://localhost:8092/api/health"}'/>
    <p>To create a user, send a <codeph>POST</codeph> request with the user as JSON:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-http">POST http://localhost:8093/api/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ada", "job": "engineer"}</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"httpRequest":{"url":"http://localhost:8093/api/users","method":"post","request":{"headers":"Content-Type: application/json","body":"{\"name\": \"Ada\", \"job\": \"engineer\"}"},"statusCodes":[200,201],"response":{"body":{"name":"Ada","job":"engineer"}},"allowAdditionalFields":false}}'/>
    <p>The response echoes the user you sent.</p>
    <p>To list the second page of users, send a <codeph>GET</codeph> request with the <codeph>page</codeph> parameter:</p>
    <codeblock>GET http://localhost:8092/api/users?page=2
X-Test: docs</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"httpRequest":{"url":"http://localhost:8092/api/users","method":"get","request":{"headers":{"X-Test":"docs"},"parameters":{"page":"2"}},"timeout":10000,"response":{"headers":{"x-echo-test":"docs"},"body":{"page":"2"},"required":["page"]},"path":"users-page-2.json","maxVariation":0.1,"overwrite":"aboveVariation"}}'/>
    <p>The response echoes the <codeph>page</codeph> parameter, and its <codeph>x-echo-test</codeph> header repeats the <codeph>X-Test</codeph> header you sent.</p>
    <data name="doc-detective" value="test end"/>
  </body>
</topic>
